# Dea/L1 API Markdown Index

*{% include 'tagline.txt.j2' %}*

Generated API reference index for the Dea/L1 codebase.

This index is built from Doxygen XML generated from source comments and docstrings for:


- Canonical compiler sources written in L0 under `compiler/src/`


- Shared L1 standard library modules under `compiler/shared/l1/stdlib/`
- Shared runtime API headers under `compiler/shared/runtime/include/`
- Shared native implementation support under `compiler/support/`

Design and reference documents are located in the repository's `docs` directory and are not duplicated in this
index.

## About

- Project: Dea/L1, a systems language that compiles through C to native executables.
- Source repository: [github.com/dea-lang/dea](https://github.com/dea-lang/dea).
- Created and maintained by `gwz` ([\@googlielmo](https://github.com/googlielmo)).

## Overview

This API reference supports both source-first and symbol-first browsing.
Source-set hubs provide broad context, source pages and dedicated type pages provide detail.


